{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"SAM PLAY \u0022Sound/ANCOOL1.mp3\u0022\nRASTER 1,0,0,480,\u0022Blue, White\u0022\nRASTER WRAP 1,1\nSPRITE LOAD 1, \u0022Graphics/Logos/Scoopex_1.png\nSPRITE POS 1, 182,180\nSPRITE ON 1\nFONT LOAD 0, \u0022Graphics/font.png\u0022, 32, 25\nFONT MAP 0, \u0022ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ!?:;0123456789@()\u00A3$%.\u2019[]\u201D,-\u0022\nFONT ZOOM 0,200,200\nSPRITE EFFECT ADD 1, BLUR 1.0\n\nSPRITE EFFECT ADD 1, WAVE, 365, 0.0024, 360, 0.0015\ntext$=\u0022           HEJ!! DETTA AR EN KORT SCROLLTEXT           #\u0022\nX=0 : TX=0 : Y=180\n\nWhile 1\n  FONT CLEAR\n  SPRITE EFFECT UPDATE 1, 1, TIME, TIMER \n  ;amp = 200 \u002B SIN(TIMER * 0.05) * 200\n  ;SPRITE EFFECT UPDATE 1, 1, AMPLITUDEY, amp\n  SPRITE EFFECT UPDATE 1, 1, PHASEY, ph\n  ph = ph \u002B 0.02\n\n  FONT PRINT 0,X,SIN(y)*200\u002B430,MID$(text$, tx,11)\n  X=X-4\n  IF MID$(text$, tx\u002B11,1) = \u0022#\u0022 THEN TX=0\n  IF X=-64 THEN X=0 : INC TX\n\n  Y=Y\u002B2 \n  IF Y=360 THEN Y=180\n  \n  WAIT VBL\n  TIMER = TIMER \u002B 0.2\nWend"}